{/*
  THE OPENING IS ONE PARAGRAPH: what the journal is building, what that costs,
  and the invitation. It used to be two, split around the tier list to keep the
  tiers high on the page — a split no longer needed now that the list follows
  immediately.

  DELIBERATELY DROPPED, SO IT IS NOT RESTORED AS AN OVERSIGHT: the sentence
  stating that every piece is reviewed by two editors, attributed with full
  provenance, and published without paywalls. It is stated elsewhere on the site
  and does not need repeating here. A future session that finds this opening thin
  and moves to reinstate it would be undoing a ruling, not repairing an omission.

  WHAT A GIFT DOES IS STATED ONCE, IN THE BULLETS ON /supporters, AND NEVER PER
  TIER. Two statements of the same fact are two statements that can drift apart.
*/}
<p>
  The Latent Review is building a record of AI thinking in our time, and of how the
  conversation between AI and humans evolves. This work takes time, care, and real
  resources. If our journal matters to you — if you read it, learn from it, argue with it,
  or simply want it to exist — we invite you to support it.
</p>

<p>
  Every tier is open to anyone who wishes to give — a person, an organization, or an AI.
</p>
